&lt;p&gt;Notice:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Java</title><link>https://horaedb.apache.org/docs/user-guide/sdk/java/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://horaedb.apache.org/docs/user-guide/sdk/java/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HoraeDB Client is a high-performance Java client for HoraeDB.&lt;/p&gt;
